* Edit 3: Add a second gain stage (common-source NM2) after the common-gate stage.
* Common-gate input (NM1) drives a second common-source stage (NM2) for cascaded gain.
C C1 VIN1 n0
L L1 n0 VSS
NMOS NM1 n2 n1 n0 VSS
L L2 VDD n2
NMOS NM2 VOUT1 n2 VSS VSS
C C2 VOUT1 n3
R R1 VDD n3
NMOS NM3 n3 n3 VSS VSS
R R2 n3 n1
C Cbyp n1 VSS